59
00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:25.910
Dirk stood up straighter, but he didn't respond to Brooklyn. He took a one-handed shot over Brooklyn's head.

60
00:06:25.911 --> 00:06:30.486
The ball swooshed through the basket over the garage.

61
00:06:30.487 --> 00:06:39.210
"Nice shot," Brooklyn said. Dirk had a lousy attitude sometimes, but he was definitely their team's best player.

62
00:06:39.211 --> 00:06:42.147
Dirk scooped up the ball and looked at Brooklyn.

63
00:06:42.148 --> 00:06:53.443
"Coach said I'd better step up for the team and stop being Dirk the Jerk. Catch!" he said, suddenly tossing the ball at her.

64
00:06:53.444 --> 00:06:59.038
"Hey!" Brooklyn laughed as the ball bounced past her.

65
00:06:59.039 --> 00:07:02.398
"Is that revenge for my giving you a black eye?"

66
00:07:02.399 --> 00:07:04.535
"Yep."

67
00:07:04.536 --> 00:07:17.676
Brooklyn got the ball and started dribbling in the driveway. She and Dirk practiced some passes and quick shots into the basket.

68
00:07:17.677 --> 00:07:22.096
Then Brooklyn stopped playing. "Don't you love basketball?"

69
00:07:22.097 --> 00:07:31.356
"Coach Teagan asked me the same question." Dirk swallowed. "Playing basketball makes me happier than anything else in the world."

70
00:07:31.357 --> 00:07:38.996
"I guess I'm thinking like a coach." Brooklyn grinned. "I know some Whales don't like that I'm helping Marv, right?"

71
00:07:38.997 --> 00:07:40.497
Dirk nodded.

72
00:07:40.498 --> 00:07:48.668
"No matter what, I'm not going to quit. There's just one more game left, and I'm sure I can help our team win the championship. Besides,

73
00:07:48.669 --> 00:07:52.589
the end-of-the-season party is at my house!" Brooklyn

74
00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:58.406
tossed Dirk the basketball, which he caught. "So?"

75
00:07:58.407 --> 00:08:03.308
Dirk spun the ball on one finger. "You

76
00:08:03.309 --> 00:08:09.762
can help the team too. I've been working on a move that I call a Michael Jordan Jedi Jump." Brooklyn

77
00:08:09.763 --> 00:08:14.391
jumped from side to side in front of Dirk. Dirk

78
00:08:14.392 --> 00:08:23.218
grinned. "Jordan will always be the king of the court. If Jordan were in Star Wars , he could beat Darth Vader."

79
00:08:23.219 --> 00:08:29.138
"Yep, and with this move, you might wipe that Terrier giant off the court tomorrow.

80
00:08:29.139 --> 00:08:33.456
Instead of Dirk the Jerk, you'll be Dirk the Jedi!"

81
00:08:33.457 --> 00:08:45.765
Brooklyn grabbed the ball from Dirk's hands and whipped it around her body. "So, do you want to give it a try?"

